			dependencies: ["3F30439847E13BD6"]
			description: [
				"\"So, we've got a vial and a lab, what next?\" I hear you ask. Well, this is where we begin to use the lab."
				"When you use the bio-lab, you'll be met with the following screen. Like all other machines, the bio-lab requires &onutrients&r, found through the bar on the left. The top four slots are your &o&6ingredients&r and the center is your &o&6base&r. Much like regular potions, you use a base item when creating compounds and serums."
				"&o&6The Organic Compound&r serves as your basis for all future alchemy. Every single serum starts off as this. Try making some."
